==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|þrettán}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*þritehun}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθrɛhtauːn/|lang=is}}

===Numeral===
{{head|is|number}}

# {{lb|is|cardinal}} '''[[thirteen]]'''; the cardinal number after [[tólf#Icelandic|tólf]] and before [[fjórtán#Icelandic|fjórtán]].
#: {{ux|is|Það eru '''þrettán''' [[jólasveinn|jólasveinar]] í [[íslenskur|íslenskum]] [[þjóðsaga|þjóðsögum]].|t=There are '''thirteen''' Yule Lads in the Icelandic [[legend]]s.}}

====Related terms====
* {{qualifier|ordinal form}} {{l|is|þrettándi}}

